    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry Property Consultants are delighted to present this three-bedroom semi-detached residence to the market. Situated in the popular and well-established area of Upper Mell on the north side of Drogheda, this property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation and represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors alike.\r\n\r\nBuilt circa 1983 and extending to approximately 77m², the property has been well maintained and benefits from new windows, new doors and new appliances, together with Oil-Fired Central Heating. The accommodation briefly comprises Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, 3 Bedrooms and Family Bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private driveway with ample off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nUpper Mell enjoys an excellent location on the north side of Drogheda, approximately a 15-minute walk from Drogheda Town Centre, where residents can enjoy a wide range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and pharmacies.\r\n\r\nThe property is also conveniently located close to a selection of primary and secondary schools, Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital, gyms, sporting facilities and a host of other local amenities. St. Joseph’s National School and Aldi are both within easy walking distance, further enhancing the convenience of this location.\r\n\r\nThe M1 Retail Park is also within walking distance, while Drogheda Train Station and Bus Station are easily accessible, providing regular public transport services.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property is approximately a 2-minute drive from the M1 Motorway, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin, Dundalk and beyond.\r\n\r\nDrogheda Town Centre – 15-minute walk\r\nM1 Motorway – Approximately 2 minutes\r\nM1 Retail Park – Within walking distance\r\nDrogheda Train Station – Within easy reach\r\nDrogheda Bus Station – Within easy reach\r\nDundalk – Approximately 30 minutes\r\nDublin – Approximately 40 minutes\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom semi-detached home in a mature and established residential location, offering convenient access to Drogheda town centre, local amenities and the M1 motorway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Details:\r\nGROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall 4.3 X 1.8 \r\n\r\nLiving Room 4.5 X 3.2\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room 5.1 X 3.3\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBed 1 4.0 X 3.1\r\n\r\nBed 2 3.5 X 3.1\r\n\r\nBed 3 2.5 X 2.4\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom 2.1 X 1.8"
